dsh-local-font-picker README · Privacy and permissions：Using **Load PC fonts** invokes the browser Local Font Access API and may show a permission prompt. The browser can expose installed font metadata to this page after permission is granted.

This plugin:

- does not read or copy font files;
- does not upload font data;
- does not make network requests;
- stores no settings of its own — selected font family names are persisted by the DSH core settings, not by plugin-managed `localStorage`.
